OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused acted in
OL,4,Aself-defence, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man claims he was acting in
OL,7,Fself-defence when he fatally stabbed a
OL,8,Fman four times in the back, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FMark Carpenter, 57 denies murdering
OL,12,FHarry Jackson, 28, on 28 May.
OL,14,FThe jury at Plymouth Crown Court heard
OL,15,FCarpenter claimed Jackson had assaulted
OL,16,Fhim twice before he stabbed him in
OL,17,Fself-defence.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
