OL,4,Aself-defence, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Dan Pawson-Pounds said
OL,7,FJackson's body was found at the bottom
OL,8,Fof the stairs by another resident in a
OL,9,Fmulti occupancy house in Embankment
OL,10,FRoad, Plymouth, Devon, about five hours
OL,11,Fafter the incident.
